        {
          "id": 575729182,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I am not running an in-tree build, but running the `deb-package` target still causes these files to appear in the stated locations.\n\nI think that may be an artefact of how `dpkg-build` et al work, but I'm not a package developer or whatever they're called. I just use the `deb-package` target to make sure I don't miss any important symbols in the `*.symbols` files.",
